{"id":"9eb88cb14d7f1646","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-gl-fixed-point-uniqueness.md","title":"GL 受保护不动点的唯一性公式","display":"thm-gl-fixed-point-uniqueness — GL 受保护不动点的唯一性公式","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-gl-fixed-point-uniqueness","aliases":["72-thm-gl-fixed-point-uniqueness"],"display":"thm-gl-fixed-point-uniqueness — GL 受保护不动点的唯一性公式","depends_on":["[[72-df-modal-guarded-context]]","[[72-thm-gl-finite-completeness]]"],"chapter":"VII","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.VII §4, Theorems 4.1–4.3, print484/PDF496; §2 notation print477/PDF489","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"local argument checked; not machine checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"created":"2026-10-22","revision_round":"2026-10-22-expansion"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-gl-fixed-point-uniqueness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-gl-fixed-point-uniqueness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-gl-fixed-point-uniqueness — GL 受保护不动点的唯一性公式"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a77c8090d251f76a\" href=\"?note=a77c8090d251f76a\" title=\"72-df-modal-guarded-context\">72-df-modal-guarded-context</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d40b90e274cadbda\" href=\"?note=d40b90e274cadbda\" title=\"72-thm-gl-finite-completeness\">72-thm-gl-finite-completeness</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"VII"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.VII §4, Theorems 4.1–4.3, print484/PDF496; §2 notation print477/PDF489"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local argument checked; not machine checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-22"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-22-expansion"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B,C\\in\\mathcal F_m\">\\(A,B,C\\in\\mathcal F_m\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in\\omega\">\\(i\\in\\omega\\)</span>；语法及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Guard}_i,\\boxdot_m\">\\(\\operatorname{Guard}_i,\\boxdot_m\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a77c8090d251f76a\" href=\"?note=a77c8090d251f76a\" title=\"72-df-modal-guarded-context\">72-df-modal-guarded-context</a>，有限模型完备性使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d40b90e274cadbda\" href=\"?note=d40b90e274cadbda\" title=\"72-thm-gl-finite-completeness\">72-thm-gl-finite-completeness</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Guard}_i(A)\\ \\Longrightarrow\\\n\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}\\left[\n\\boxdot_m\\bigl((B\\leftrightarrow_m A[B/p_i])\\land_m(C\\leftrightarrow_m A[C/p_i])\\bigr)\n\\to_m(B\\leftrightarrow_m C)\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Guard}_i(A)\\ \\Longrightarrow\\\n\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}\\left[\n\\boxdot_m\\bigl((B\\leftrightarrow_m A[B/p_i])\\land_m(C\\leftrightarrow_m A[C/p_i])\\bigr)\n\\to_m(B\\leftrightarrow_m C)\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是原书 Theorem 4.1 的一致代入形式。给出有限模型证明：假设 w 及其全部后继满足两个不动点方程。按有限严格关系从后继向前归纳。在每个后继上已知 B、C 等值时，受保护的 A 在当前世界的两个代入同值；再用当前世界的两个方程得到 B、C 同值。传递性确保对后继使用归纳时仍拥有它及其全部后继上的方程。最后用有限完备性。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\boxdot\">\\(\\boxdot\\)</span> 中未加框的方程不可删除；在终端世界只有方框条件时，对 B、C 没有约束。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-modal-guarded-context","status":"resolved","id":"a77c8090d251f76a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-modal-guarded-context]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-thm-gl-finite-completeness","status":"resolved","id":"d40b90e274cadbda","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-thm-gl-finite-completeness]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-modal-guarded-context","status":"resolved","id":"a77c8090d251f76a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A,B,C\\in\\mathcal F_m$，$i\\in\\omega$；语法及 $\\operatorname{Guard}_i,\\boxdot_m$ 使用 [[72-df-modal-guarded-context]]，有限模型完备性使用 [[72-thm-gl-finite-completeness]]。","embed":false},{"target":"72-thm-gl-finite-completeness","status":"resolved","id":"d40b90e274cadbda","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A,B,C\\in\\mathcal F_m$，$i\\in\\omega$；语法及 $\\operatorname{Guard}_i,\\boxdot_m$ 使用 [[72-df-modal-guarded-context]]，有限模型完备性使用 [[72-thm-gl-finite-completeness]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A,B,C\\in\\mathcal F_m","display":false},{"tex":"i\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Guard}_i,\\boxdot_m","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Guard}_i(A)\\ \\Longrightarrow\\\n\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}\\left[\n\\boxdot_m\\bigl((B\\leftrightarrow_m A[B/p_i])\\land_m(C\\leftrightarrow_m A[C/p_i])\\bigr)\n\\to_m(B\\leftrightarrow_m C)\\right].","display":true},{"tex":"\\boxdot","display":false}],"bytes":1858,"backlinks":[{"id":"e5f1bec08e140ae9","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A,B,C\\in\\mathcal F_m$，$i\\in\\omega$；沿用 [[72-thm-gl-fixed-point-uniqueness]] 的语法、保护谓词和可证性。"},{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-177","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VII章新增12项：[[72-cor-gl-fixed-point-equivalence]] · [[72-df-magari-algebra]] · [[72-df-modal-guarded-context]] · [[72-df-modal-reflection-logic]] · [[72-df-root-sound-modal-model]] · [[72-ex-gl-consistency-fixed-point]] · [[72-ex-gl-semantic-noncompactness]] · [[72-lem-modal-guarded-replacement]] · [[72-lem-modal-root-duplication]] · [[72-thm-finite-frame-magari-algebra]] · [[72-thm-gl-fixed-point-existence]] · [[72-thm-gl-fixed-point-uniqueness]]"},{"id":"6aa9c9e25ba49583","anchor":"ref-174","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VII章新增12项：[[72-cor-gl-fixed-point-equivalence]] · [[72-df-magari-algebra]] · [[72-df-modal-guarded-context]] · [[72-df-modal-reflection-logic]] · [[72-df-root-sound-modal-model]] · [[72-ex-gl-consistency-fixed-point]] · [[72-ex-gl-semantic-noncompactness]] · [[72-lem-modal-guarded-replacement]] · [[72-lem-modal-root-duplication]] · [[72-thm-finite-frame-magari-algebra]] · [[72-thm-gl-fixed-point-existence]] · [[72-thm-gl-fixed-point-uniqueness]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-547","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VII章新增12项：[[72-cor-gl-fixed-point-equivalence]] · [[72-df-magari-algebra]] · [[72-df-modal-guarded-context]] · [[72-df-modal-reflection-logic]] · [[72-df-root-sound-modal-model]] · [[72-ex-gl-consistency-fixed-point]] · [[72-ex-gl-semantic-noncompactness]] · [[72-lem-modal-guarded-replacement]] · [[72-lem-modal-root-duplication]] · [[72-thm-finite-frame-magari-algebra]] · [[72-thm-gl-fixed-point-existence]] · [[72-thm-gl-fixed-point-uniqueness]]"}],"outgoing":["a77c8090d251f76a","d40b90e274cadbda"]}